# The packed artifact's sha256 is pinned by the TREK-Plugins registry, so the
# bytes have to come out the same on every machine that builds it. Without this,
# a checkout on Windows with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the sources to CRLF and
# `trek-plugin pack` produces a different hash than the one the registry
# recorded — an install that fails a checksum for no visible reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
